      "writtenOn": "2023-08-14T21:27:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Yongqin:\n\nThis looks like due to inner working of the `ptp_kvm` than module loading issue.\n\nLooks like you are hitting this: https://cs.android.com/android/kernel/superproject/+/common-android15-6.1:common/drivers/ptp/ptp_kvm_arm.c;l\u003d20\n\n`ptp_kvm.ko` will only load when the kvm hypervisor is available on the target. Do you know whether it is on your target?\n\nThanks,  \nRamji",
